{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03125","headline":"和苏侍郎小园夕霁寄诸弟 · 张九龄","name":"和苏侍郎小园夕霁寄诸弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清风阊阖至，轩盖承明归。\n云月爱秋景，林堂开夜扉。\n何言兼济日，尚与宴私违。\n兴逐蒹葭变，文因棠棣飞。\n人伦用忠孝，帝德已光辉。\n赠弟今爲贵，方知陆氏微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}